# Dependency Injection

Pass a stateful service's dependencies through its constructor. That service must not construct its collaborator through a hidden import.

Pure functions do not need injection. An argument is enough.

```ts
class MediaManager {
  constructor(private readonly storage: FileStorage) {}

  save(file: File) {
    return this.storage.put(file);
  }
}
```
